# Cursor rules — Universal Loop Agent

Plan: `Universal_Loop_Agent_Plan.md`. Índice: `Indice.md`.

## Stack

- TypeScript + Bun. Prefer `bun` scripts over npm when both exist.
- Types live only in `src/schema.ts`.
- Section generators in `src/sections/**` return `string | null` (never empty string).

## Workflow

- Config source: `universal-agent.yaml` → `uagent generate` → `AGENTS.md`.
- Canonical handoff: `MEMORIA_PROYECTO.md` at project root; `.uagent/memory/` is stubs only.
- Paths in versioned files must be relative (portable across machines).
- After substantive changes: `bun test`, `bun run typecheck`, update plan/índice if structure changed.

## Ownership (this repo)

- core: `src/schema.ts`, `src/parser.ts`, `src/generator.ts`, `src/cli.ts`, `src/detector.ts`, `src/memory.ts`, `src/yaml-generator.ts`
- sections (integrator): `src/sections/**`
